{
  "info": {
    "name": "Healio — Microservices API",
    "description": "SE3020 Distributed Systems — Healio Healthcare Platform\nBase URL: http://localhost:3001/api\n\nServices & Ports:\n  API Gateway        → :3001  (all HTTP traffic)\n  Auth Service       → :5001  (TCP, internal)\n  Patient Service    → :5002  (TCP, internal)\n  Doctor Service     → :5003  (TCP, internal)\n  Appointment Svc    → :5004  (TCP, internal)\n  Telemedicine Svc   → :5005  (TCP, internal)\n  Payment Service    → :5006  (TCP, internal)\n  Notification Svc   → :5007  (TCP, internal)\n  AI Service         → :5008  (TCP, internal — requires GROQ_API_KEY)\n\nQuick start:\n1. Run 'Register Patient', 'Register Doctor', 'Register Admin' (tokens auto-saved)\n2. Doctor: set availability, update profile (set consultationFee)\n3. Admin: verify the doctor\n4. Patient: book appointment\n5. Doctor: confirm appointment (triggers Stripe Checkout)\n6. Patient: complete payment (auto-creates a Jitsi telemedicine session)\n7. Patient or Doctor: join session using the auto-created session_id\n8. Patient: use AI Symptom Checker (section 7) — requires GROQ_API_KEY in .env\n\nCollection variables are auto-populated by test scripts.",
    "_postman_id": "healio-microservices-2026",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base",
      "value": "http://localhost:3001/api",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "API Gateway base URL (all requests route through here)"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Patient JWT"
    },
    {
      "key": "doctor_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Doctor JWT"
    },
    {
      "key": "admin_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Admin JWT"
    },
    {
      "key": "patient_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Patient userId (from login response)"
    },
    {
      "key": "doctor_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Doctor userId (from login response)"
    },
    {
      "key": "appointment_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Auto-saved on Book Appointment"
    },
    {
      "key": "payment_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Auto-saved on Initiate Payment"
    },
    {
      "key": "session_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Auto-saved on Create Session"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register Patient",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.access_token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.access_token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('patient_id', res.user.id);",
                  "  console.log('Patient token saved, id:', res.user.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"John Patient\",\n  \"email\": \"patient@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123\",\n  \"role\": \"patient\",\n  \"phone\": \"0771234567\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{base}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register Doctor",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
